Title sdl2quake
Version 1.3
Description Quake for OPENSTEP 4.2 on Intel i486: squake (software renderer, AppKit window), glquake_g450 (hardware, drawn by a Matrox G450 through the OpenStepMGA driver's accelerated Mesa -- requires OSMGADisplay 1.3+ with VRAM Mmap and Mesa Acceleration set to Yes) and glquake_radeon (the same engine drawn by an ATI Radeon 9250 -- requires OSRDNDisplay 1.0 installed and active). All three statically linked; no libraries are installed. Up to 1.2 the Matrox binary was called glquake: delete an older sdl2quake in Installer before installing this one, or an old glquake is left beside the new files. Game data is NOT included: install sdl2quake-libre at the same place, or provide your own id1 directory.
DefaultLocation /usr/local/quake
Relocatable YES
Application NO
UseUserMask NO
DiskName SDL2 Quake OPENSTEP Intel
DeleteWarning Removing this package removes the three engine binaries and their documentation. The game data package beside them is untouched.
